<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>RYUJEAN DOMAIN HQ | 유정근 총괄 마스터 대시보드</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Pretendard', '-apple-system', 'BlinkMacSystemFont', 'sans-serif'] },
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#f0f9ff',
                            100: '#e0f2fe',
                            500: '#0ea5e9',
                            600: '#0284c7',
                            900: '#0c4a6e',
                            950: '#082f49'
                        },
                        darkSurface: {
                            800: '#1e293b',
                            850: '#151f32',
                            900: '#0f172a',
                            950: '#090d16'
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pretendard:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }
        .glass-card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15);
        }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.5); border-radius: 999px; }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.7); }
    </style>

<style id="web-guidelines-enhancement">
    /* Vercel & W3C Standard Focus & Typography Enhancements */
    :focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid #C5A869 !important;
        outline-offset: 2px !important;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }
    h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
        text-wrap: balance;
    }
    p, li {
        text-wrap: pretty;
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        *, ::before, ::after {
            animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
            animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
            transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
            scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        }
    }
    button, a, input, select, textarea {
        touch-action: manipulation;
    }
</style>

</head>
<body class="bg-darkSurface-950 text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-brand-500 selection:text-white">

    <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-darkSurface-900/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80 px-4 sm:px-8 py-3.5">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 w-full md:w-auto justify-between md:justify-start">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-600 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/20 text-white font-black text-lg">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cube"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <h1 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                                RYUJEAN DOMAIN HQ
                            </h1>
                            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 border border-brand-500/30">
                                ENTERPRISE OS
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">
                            총괄: <strong class="text-slate-200">유정근 디렉터</strong> • 실시간 통합 도메인 & 프로젝트 관제 포털
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Mobile Actions -->
                <div class="md:hidden flex items-center gap-2">
                    <button onclick="openNewDomainModal()" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-brand-600 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Header Quick Actions -->
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5 w-full md:w-auto justify-end">
                <button onclick="openNewDomainModal()" class="hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-md shadow-brand-500/20 transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-plus-circle"></i> 새 도메인/프로젝트 등록
                </button>
                <a href="https://github.com/ryujean77/ryujeanWorkSpace" target="_blank" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-darkSurface-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i> Workspace
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/ryujean77/ryujean-slides" target="_blank" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-darkSurface-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-globe"></i> Live Slides
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 w-full space-y-8 flex-1">

        <!-- 4 KPI Summary Cards -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 relative overflow-hidden group transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">총 비즈니스 도메인</span>
                    <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i></span>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-3 flex items-baseline gap-2">
                    <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white" id="stat-domain-count">4</span>
                    <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 font-semibold">+ 1 인프라</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">아로마 • 패션 • 호모루미누스 • 사상체질</p>
                <div class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 w-20 h-20 bg-emerald-500/5 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:bg-emerald-500/10 transition"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 relative overflow-hidden group transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">등록 프로젝트 / 산출물</span>
                    <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-folder-tree"></i></span>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-3 flex items-baseline gap-2">
                    <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white" id="stat-project-count">12</span>
                    <span class="text-xs text-indigo-400 font-semibold">100% 자산화</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">MD + 디자인 HTML 듀얼 산출물</p>
                <div class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 w-20 h-20 bg-indigo-500/5 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:bg-indigo-500/10 transition"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 relative overflow-hidden group transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">라이브 웹 배포 완료</span>
                    <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-satellite-dish"></i></span>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-3 flex items-baseline gap-2">
                    <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white" id="stat-live-count">8</span>
                    <span class="text-xs text-brand-400 font-semibold">GitHub Pages</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">1초 원클릭 고객/외부 공유 가능</p>
                <div class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 w-20 h-20 bg-brand-500/5 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:bg-brand-500/10 transition"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 relative overflow-hidden group transition">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400">탑재 자동화 스킬</span>
                    <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i></span>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-3 flex items-baseline gap-2">
                    <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white">12</span>
                    <span class="text-xs text-amber-400 font-semibold">스킬 엔진</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">슬랙봇 • 처방엔진 • 슬라이드빌더</p>
                <div class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 w-20 h-20 bg-amber-500/5 rounded-full blur-xl group-hover:bg-amber-500/10 transition"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 4 Core Domains Visual Grid -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shapes text-brand-400"></i> 4대 핵심 비즈니스 도메인 인벤토리
                </h2>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Domain Registry Master</span>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5" id="domain-cards-container">
                <!-- Injected via JS -->
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Search, Filter & Project List Section -->
        <section class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 border border-slate-800">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-5 border-b border-slate-800">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check text-indigo-400"></i> 세부 프로젝트 & 산출물 통합 관리 리스트
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">모든 프로젝트의 산출물 파일, 라이브 배포 링크 및 작업 현황을 실시간으로 제어합니다.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Search Input -->
                <div class="relative w-full md:w-72">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400 text-xs"></i>
                    <input type="text" id="searchInput" oninput="filterProjects()" placeholder="프로젝트명, 도메인, 키워드 검색…" 
                        class="w-full bg-darkSurface-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl pl-9 pr-4 py-2 text-xs text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-500 transition">
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Filter Pills -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
                <span class="text-slate-400 font-bold mr-1 text-[11px]"><i class="fa-solid fa-filter"></i> 도메인 필터:</span>
                <button onclick="setDomainFilter('ALL')" id="filter-btn-ALL" class="domain-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold bg-brand-600 text-white shadow-sm transition">전체보기 (12)</button>
                <button onclick="setDomainFilter('DOM-AROMA')" id="filter-btn-DOM-AROMA" class="domain-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium text-slate-300 bg-darkSurface-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 transition">🌿 아로마테라피</button>
                <button onclick="setDomainFilter('DOM-FASHION')" id="filter-btn-DOM-FASHION" class="domain-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium text-slate-300 bg-darkSurface-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 transition">👗 패션테라피</button>
                <button onclick="setDomainFilter('DOM-LUMINUS')" id="filter-btn-DOM-LUMINUS" class="domain-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium text-slate-300 bg-darkSurface-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 transition">🌌 호모루미누스</button>
                <button onclick="setDomainFilter('DOM-SASANG')" id="filter-btn-DOM-SASANG" class="domain-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium text-slate-300 bg-darkSurface-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 transition">🧬 사상체질</button>
                <button onclick="setDomainFilter('DOM-INFRA')" id="filter-btn-DOM-INFRA" class="domain-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium text-slate-300 bg-darkSurface-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 transition">⚙️ 중앙 인프라</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Project Cards Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4" id="project-cards-container">
                <!-- Injected via JS -->
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Modal for New Domain / Project Registration Guide -->
    <div id="newDomainModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="glass-card bg-darkSurface-900 max-w-2xl w-full rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl space-y-5 relative">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-slate-800">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-white">새 도메인 / 신규 프로젝트 등록 방법</h3>
                </div>
                <button onclick="closeNewDomainModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-lg">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-darkSurface-950 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
                    <span class="font-bold text-brand-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">방법 1. 대화창에서 AI에게 바로 요청하기 (가장 간편)</span>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">
                        "<code>새로운 도메인으로 [부동산 웰니스] 추가해줘</code>" 또는 "<code>[도서관 3차 출강] 신규 프로젝트 등록해줘</code>"라고 말씀하시면, AI가 마스터 레지스트리(`domain_master_registry.json`)와 포털 대시보드에 즉시 자동 등록하고 배포합니다.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-darkSurface-950 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
                    <span class="font-bold text-indigo-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">방법 2. 산출물 폴더 규칙 (law.md 준수)</span>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">
                        새로운 작업이 시작될 때마다 <code>산출물/YYYYMMDD_HHMM_프로젝트명/</code> 폴더가 생성되며, 작업 완료 시 자동으로 이 대시보드에 연동 및 라이브 링크가 배포됩니다.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-2 flex justify-end">
                <button onclick="closeNewDomainModal()" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow transition">
                    확인 및 닫기
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-darkSurface-900 border-t border-slate-800/80 px-4 py-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <p class="font-medium text-slate-400">RYUJEAN DOMAIN HQ • 유정근 웰니스 총괄 & 프로젝트 디렉터</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-600">Powered by Antigravity AI Engine • Single Source of Truth Architecture</p>
    </footer>

