ple-400 border border-purple-500/30", "date": "2026-08-25", "liveUrl": "", "deliverables": [{"name": "슬랙 리스너 데몬", "type": "py", "path": "scripts/slack_bot_listener.py"}, {"name": "슬랙 전송 CLI", "type": "py", "path": "scripts/send_slack.py"}, {"name": "스킬 매뉴얼", "type": "md", "path": "SKILL.md"}], "description": "공인 IP 없이 스마트폰 슬랙 채널(#workspace) 및 1:1 DM에서 유정근 대표님의 지시를 받아 실시간 처리하는 AI 봇 데몬."}, {"id": "PRJ-INFRA-03", "domainId": "DOM-INFRA", "domainTag": "⚙️ 중앙 인프라", "title": "2026년 8월 25일 일일 업무일지 & 시스템 구축 보고서", "folder": "20260825_0143_일일_업무일지_아로마도메인_구축_및_슬랙봇연동", "status": "배포완료", "statusBadge": "bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30", "date": "2026-08-25", "liveUrl": "https://ryujean77.github.io/ryujean-slides/daily-log-20260825/", "deliverables": [{"name": "업무일지 리포트 (HTML)", "type": "html", "path": "업무일지_20260825.html"}, {"name": "업무일지 원본 (MD)", "type": "md", "path": "업무일지_20260825.md"}], "description": "아로마 도메인 구축, 온라인 수익 극대화 기획서 발행, 양방향 슬랙 봇 연동 완료 일일 종합 업무일지."}]};
        let currentDomainFilter = 'ALL';

        // Render Domains
        function renderDomains() {
            const container = document.getElementById('domain-cards-container');
            container.innerHTML = masterDB.domains.map(d => `
                <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 relative overflow-hidden group transition border border-slate-800 hover:border-${d.color}-500/50 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div class="space-y-3">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-${d.color}-500/20 text-${d.color}-400 flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold border border-${d.color}-500/30">
                                <i class="fa-solid ${d.icon}"></i>
                            </span>
                            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-darkSurface-900 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">
                                ${d.stats.status}
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-base font-black text-white group-hover:text-${d.color}-400 transition">${d.name}</h3>
                            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1 font-medium"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie mr-1 text-slate-500"></i> ${d.partner}</p>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">${d.summary}</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 font-mono text-[11px]">${d.stats.projectsCount}개 프로젝트 등록</span>
                        <button onclick="setDomainFilter('${d.id}')" class="text-${d.color}-400 hover:underline font-bold text-xs inline-flex items-center gap-1">
                            프로젝트 보기 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-[10px]"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            `).join('');
        }

        // Render Projects
        function renderProjects(projectsToRender) {
            const container = document.getElementById('project-cards-container');
            if (projectsToRender.length === 0) {
                container.innerHTML = `
                    <div class="col-span-2 py-12 text-center text-slate-500 text-sm">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-box-open text-3xl mb-2"></i>
                        <p>해당 조건에 맞는 프로젝트가 없습니다.</p>
                    </div>
                `;
                return;
            }

            container.innerHTML = projectsToRender.map(p => `
                <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-darkSurface-900/90 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition space-y-3.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                            <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[11px] font-bold bg-darkSurface-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">
                                ${p.domainTag}
                            </span>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono">${p.date}</span>
                                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold ${p.statusBadge}">${p.status}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white leading-snug">${p.title}</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">${p.description}</p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Deliverable Tags & Links -->
                    <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-800 space-y-2">
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                            ${p.deliverables.map(d => `
                                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-darkSurface-800 text-slate-300 text-[10px] border border-slate-700 font-mono">
                                    <i class="fa-regular fa-file-lines text-slate-500 mr-1"></i>${d.name}
                                </span>
                            `).join('')}
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-1">
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono truncate max-w-[200px]" title="${p.folder}">
                                📁 ${p.folder}
                            </span>
                            ${p.liveUrl ? `
                                <a href="${p.liveUrl}" target="_blank" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-sm transition inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-[10px]"></i> 라이브 열기
                                </a>
                            ` : `
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium italic">내부 저장소 보관</span>
                            `}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            `).join('');
        }

        // Filter Logic
        function filterProjects() {
            const query = document.getElementById('searchInput').value.toLowerCase().trim();
            const filtered = masterDB.projects.filter(p => {
                const matchDomain = (currentDomainFilter === 'ALL') || (p.domainId === currentDomainFilter);
                const matchSearch = !query || 
                    p.title.toLowerCase().includes(query) || 
                    p.description.toLowerCase().includes(query) || 
                    p.domainTag.toLowerCase().includes(query) || 
                    p.folder.toLowerCase().includes(query);
                return matchDomain && matchSearch;
            });
            renderProjects(filtered);
        }

        function setDomainFilter(domId) {
            currentDomainFilter = domId;
            document.querySelectorAll('.domain-filter-btn').forEach(btn => {
                btn.className = 'domain-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium text-slate-300 bg-darkSurface-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 transition';
            });
            const activeBtn = document.getElementById('filter-btn-' + domId);
            if (activeBtn) {
                activeBtn.className = 'domain-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold bg-brand-600 text-white shadow-sm transition';
            }
            filterProjects();
        }

        function openNewDomainModal() {
            document.getElementById('newDomainModal').classList.remove('hidden');
        }

        function closeNewDomainModal() {
            document.getElementById('newDomainModal').classList.add('hidden');
        }

        // Init
        renderDomains();
        renderProjects(masterDB.projects);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
